/	   SAVE IMAGE (BUT NOT PART OF THE PROGRAM) HAVE BEEN IDENTIFIED.
/	   THE "LIKESV" SYMBOL CONTROLS WHETHER THESE WORDS ARE INCLUDED.
/	   SOME WORDS DOUBTLESS REMAIN THAT SHOULD BE IDENTIFIED AS CRUFT.
